  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, a category group listing called \"Mobile Worlds\" is shown at the top of the home tab. It would be preferable to see an \"iOS Worlds\" listing. Of course, we will still run around and test android conversions, but I would really love to see the native worlds, and right now, they are very hard to find. We want to ensure the native worlds are tested along with the android worlds, perhaps even more. Those of us developing them most likely intend to show how our native platform can outshine the others. The mac ecosystem has taken a lot of flack from the PC side, and it is very personal to us that we shine bright. So far, the results on native worlds are amazing... let us see them all easily.",
